{"id":"en_awakened-legends-the-nation-s-duel","title":"Awakened Legends: The Nation’s Duel","titleEn":"Awakened Legends: The Nation’s Duel","description":"When the Blue Star mutated, historical heroes were awakened around the world, and nations began settling their fates through battle. Kunzhou, a land with thousands of years of glorious history, had endured a century of humiliation and was close to ruin because its people had forgotten their past. In the final battle, the reborn Chen Yi steps forward, awakens heroes who had been forgotten, and shifts the course of the fight. He goes on to recover lost territories, uncover the truth behind the gap in history, and restore Kunzhou to its former glory.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakened-legends-the-nations-duel/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakened-legends-the-nations-duel/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Animation","Action & Adventure","Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d93m8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_awakened-legends-the-nation-s-duel_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d93m8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakened-legends-the-nation-s-duel_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d93m8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakened-legends-the-nation-s-duel_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d93m8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakened-legends-the-nation-s-duel_4","title":"Episode 4","season":